ANCIENT WISDOM: The Art of Execution
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

The metallic clang of weapons echoes through the chamber
as you enter the armoury.  Ancient weapons, magickal potions,
